From 6315c883538b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hemang Kumawat <HemangKumawat@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 02:43:14 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 6] coral: add calibrated display, wake touch and bounded charging

Wire panel followers with balanced gesture IRQ wake, calibrated 90Hz and low-power panel controls, stock coral haptic resources, MAX1730x identity handling, and PM8150B SRAM battery temperature. Correct SMB5 register encoding and status, bound charging to board limits, and retain measured hardware JEITA configuration.

Source commit: 6315c883538b (diff against 472bb39eac2a).
Assisted-by: AI agents (Codex, Claude) under the author's direction
---
